OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 9 Sep to Fri 18 Sep
OL,6,FChangeable initially, with some dry
OL,7,Finterludes and relatively cool nights,
OL,8,Finterspersed with occasional outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain or showers arriving from the
OL,10,Fwest, perhaps accompanied by some
OL,11,Fstrong winds at times too. However, a
OL,12,Ftrend towards more widely settled
OL,13,Fconditions seems likely from around
OL,14,Fnext weekend and beyond, as high
OL,15,Fpressure becomes increasingly
OL,16,Finfluential in the vicinity of the UK.
OL,17,FThis should lead to longer, drier
OL,18,Finterludes, especially in the south
OL,19,Fand southwest, with any rain or
OL,20,Fshowers more likely towards the north
OL,21,Fand east. Temperatures will probably
OL,22,Fbe close to average overall, though
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fstill with some relatively cool nights
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fat times.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
SC,0003
CT,20,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1788606009
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 19 Sep to Sat 3 Oct
OL,6,FHigh pressure initially close to the
OL,7,FUK, with a continuation of more
OL,8,Fsettled conditions at times, may
OL,9,Feventually start to weaken its
OL,10,Finfluence on the weather towards the
OL,11,Fend of September. As a result, it may
OL,12,Fbecome more changeable with a greater
OL,13,Fchance of rain or showers in places,
OL,14,Fand perhaps some strong winds at times
OL,15,Ftoo. Temperatures will likely be a
OL,16,Flittle above average overall, with
OL,17,Frelatively cool nights possible at
OL,18,Ffirst tending to reduce in frequency
OL,19,Flater in the period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
